{"title":"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The graph of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/2/6126cc49ca15afead70d9ae45d96a9747a0021a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^2 + 2xy + 40|x|= 400$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"180\" height=\"19\" /> partitions the plane into several regions.  What is the area of the bounded region?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The equation given can be rewritten as:\n</p>\n<dl><dd><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/b/ccb0aa1ed7f7a1e65accbff3db70ebf1cdb06d45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40|x| = - y^2 - 2xy + 400$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"194\" height=\"19\" /></dd></dl>\n<p>We can split the equation into a piecewise equation by breaking up the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Absolute_value\" title=\"Absolute value\">absolute value</a>:\n</p>\n<dl><dd><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/f/1bf5508aa1870b86a53ac5f18b73741a39bbac8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40x = -y^2 - 2xy + 400\\quad\\quad x\\ge 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"261\" height=\"18\" /></dd>\n<dd><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/4/e84c6de8ca28e4a05e96fd963b7ef6707e97da9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40x = y^2 + 2xy - 400 \\quad \\quad x &lt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"247\" height=\"18\" /></dd></dl>\n<p>Factoring the first one: (alternatively, it is also possible to <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Completing_the_square\" title=\"Completing the square\">complete the square</a>)\n</p>\n<dl><dd><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/b/08beda252d41dc0ddaae3cb3e61b673714d1d0d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40x + 2xy  = -y^2 + 400$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"184\" height=\"18\" /></dd>\n<dd><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/a/a8a9a2008b959efc26e5380a28fefe1ffcbed804.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x(20 + y)=  (20 - y)(20 + y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"238\" height=\"20\" /></dd></dl>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AIME_1998-3.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/1/18/AIME_1998-3.png/300px-AIME_1998-3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"272\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/1/18/AIME_1998-3.png/450px-AIME_1998-3.png 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/1/18/AIME_1998-3.png/600px-AIME_1998-3.png 2x\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure> \n<p>Hence, either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/0/8604446861cde7fb10d8700c3283651dd8370721.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = -20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"65\" height=\"16\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/1/3712d983f26884a563a7c7a2a700b1bd57fa30f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x = 20 - y \\Longrightarrow y = -2x + 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"240\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>Similarily, for the second one, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/e/bceaaf56dd8ffb0cd67010272ec09d10ec5c5a0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/3/433e6b09e9f8882fd6c4bb9f326f2c816bbd9e0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = -2x - 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"107\" height=\"16\" />. If we graph these four equations, we see that we get a parallelogram with base 20 and height 40. Hence the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/2/6e2d67e369a92f2b8144e14cb848201df0956b1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{800}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The equation can be rewritten as: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/d/0cda8e9fc3baef0adcfe79fc890f16c7d5399f94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+y)^2=(|x|-20)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"169\" height=\"19\" />. Do casework as above.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME\" title=\"1998 AIME\">1998 AIME </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1998 AIME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=1998\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AIME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1998 AIME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=